Reasoning: Each change is the minimal, directly-tested fix for its confirmed hypothesis; all three stay within the CUDA/CuPy-only, non-AI/ML DSP method per project-mission.md.
Output: fat_llama/audio_fattener/feed.py updated; no new imports required (cp.fft.rfft/irfft already available via existing `import cupy as cp`).

